{"c":[{"id":"0f04308dc7e8c4c7","sum":"Nap-variant-stems: four-part stem is a prefix of its five-part twin so lex heal needs no format branch; child_nap_stem names rematerialize and surgery; started_stores lists git root only when .summem is a directory.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260826T003014Z-adbfa7448201be34","text":"Nap-variant-stems reflected: QA PASS, 346 tests; a four-part stem is a prefix of its five-part twin so lex heal needs no format branch.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260826T004034Z-6b4ff0568eccf9a6","text":"child_nap_stem is the shared serialize-then-name path for rematerialize and surgery; started_stores lists the git root only when .summem is a directory.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"8ebfa75808b2336c","sum":"Driver lists five-part nap stems only; migrate.py is the only four-part reader.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260826T004244Z-cbe9baa615b860a5","text":"PR #62 is the five-part nap-stem draft; closes #61 and supersedes #59.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260826T005232Z-a1d8ce977ef75db8","text":"Clean break: driver lists five-part nap stems only; migrate.py is the only four-part reader.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
